#: ../doc/keyboard.rst:174
msgid ""
"Edit navigation uses the selected item's track, or the last clicked track if"
" nothing is selected. With no active track, it starts on the highest track "
"containing a clip or transition at the playhead, or the highest populated "
"track in a gap."
msgstr ""
"编辑导航使用选中项目的轨道，或如果没有选中任何内容，则使用最后点击的轨道。若无活动轨道，则从播放头处包含剪辑或转场的最高轨道开始，或从间隙中最高的已填充轨道开始。"

